Description: Initialize and synchronize the provider block-device lookup table
 Create sysfs_to_block before either worker can access the provider. Perform
 the known-block lookup in the probing thread under the existing provider lock,
 keeping the uevent monitor independent of main-thread device processing.
Author: Cici OpenAI <cici@aiursoft.com>
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-11

